[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_7_AGR_TO]
> Enter the Agriculture Products Venue & Dining Hall

[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_7_AGR_TO_desc]
The agriculture products venue showcases food and other agricultural products from all over the world. You can taste food in the agriculture products venue or dine in the restaurant at the end, but please do not eat the exhibits.

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_7_AGR_TO]
> 前往农产品会场与餐厅

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_7_AGR_TO_desc]
农产品会场展示来自世界各地的食物与其他农产品，您可以在农产品会场进行试吃或在尽头的餐厅用餐，但请不要食用展品。
